      ],
      "imageAt": [
        0,
        0.4
      ],
      "seconds": 16.55,
      "text": "There is a tell. Glance at an analog clock and the first second looks too long. That is the stitch. Your brain stretched the frame it kept to cover the frames it threw away. Which means vision is not a window. It is an edit, delivered so smoothly you have never once noticed the cut.",
